:"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-19T08:09:59-08:00","id":14052,"title":"","content":"My hope would be that this scenario fits nicely into the existing back-story of the Free Council. Maybe it teaches them the value in keeping their head down and so serves as a catalyst for them transforming from firebrand revolutionaries to the respected member of the Pentacle they are today.<br /> <br /> However my knowledge of Mage just isn't good enough to say if that fits the existing material.<br /> <br /> <br /> Thinking about it. I should replace the explicit reference to the Free Council with something more generic. That way people are free to use the Council if they want but they don't have to contradict the text if they'd rather keep the Free Council out of their hunter game or Hunters and Vampires away from their Free Council. (Done)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 11-19-2013, 11:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kin